---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import QuoteForm from "../components/QuoteForm.astro";
---
<Layout title="Golf Cart Rental Prices in The Villages | Plan Your Rental" description="Choose a 2, 4 or 6-passenger golf cart for your stay in The Villages. Compare rental options, prepare your dates and request a complete quote.">
<article class="guide"><header class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><p class="kicker">The Villages golf cart rentals</p><h1>Golf cart rental prices<br/>for your stay.</h1><p class="lead">Choose your passenger capacity, tell us your dates, and request a quote for your stay in The Villages. We’ll help you check the details before you reserve.</p><a class="button" href="tel:+13523064409">Call (352) 306-4409</a></div><aside class="note"><h2>Have these details ready</h2><ul><li>Your arrival and departure dates</li><li>Passenger count and number of carts</li><li>Delivery address or neighborhood</li><li>Golf bags, luggage or equipment needs</li></ul><p>A quote request starts the conversation. Confirm availability and reservation terms with the team before making plans around a cart.</p></aside></div></header>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><span class="step">01 / CHOOSE YOUR CART</span><h2>Room for everyone riding.</h2><p class="lead">Start with the number of passengers, then tell us what else you’ll carry. Passenger seats do not necessarily provide space for luggage or equipment.</p><div class="cards"><article class="card"><img src="/cart-images/2-passenger-1.jpg" alt="2-passenger rental golf cart" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy"/><div class="card-body"><h3>2 passengers</h3><p>For one or two people. Tell us if you also need space for golf bags or other equipment.</p><a href="/2-passenger-deluxe-golf-cart/">See the 2-passenger cart</a></div></article><article class="card"><img src="/cart-images/4-passenger-1.jpg" alt="4-passenger rental golf cart" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy"/><div class="card-body"><h3>4 passengers</h3><p>For up to four people. Consider everyone riding together when choosing your cart.</p><a href="/4-passenger-deluxe-golf-cart/">See the 4-passenger cart</a></div></article><article class="card"><img src="/cart-images/6-passenger-1.jpg" alt="6-passenger rental golf cart" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy"/><div class="card-body"><h3>6 passengers</h3><p>For up to six people. For a larger group, ask about availability for multiple carts.</p><a href="/6-passenger-golf-cart/">See the 6-passenger cart</a></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><span class="step">02 / PLAN YOUR STAY</span><h2>Your dates matter.</h2><p>Request pricing for your exact arrival and departure dates. A weekly package divided by seven is not necessarily a daily rate you can book for a shorter stay.</p><div class="links"><a href="/weekly-golf-cart-rental-villages/">Weekly rentals</a><a href="/monthly-golf-cart-rental-villages/">Monthly rentals</a></div></div><div><h3>Staying longer or planning ahead?</h3><p>Still waiting for your vacation address? Share your dates and neighborhood, and let the team know the exact address is pending.</p><a href="/snowbird-golf-cart-rental/">Planning a seasonal stay</a><p>Need to extend an existing rental? Contact the team before your scheduled return to check availability and the additional cost.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><span class="step">03 / CHECK THE TOTAL</span><h2>Compare the whole quote.</h2><p>Pricing depends on the cart, dates, length of rental and delivery arrangements. Ask for the total for your booking, with any applicable charges explained.</p><a href="/contact/">Request availability and pricing</a></div><aside class="note"><h3>Before you reserve, confirm:</h3><ul><li>Rental charge and minimum rental period</li><li>Delivery, pickup and any fuel charges</li><li>Taxes and any payment-related fees</li><li>Deposit, payment and cancellation terms</li><li>Delivery timing and who to call for help</li></ul></aside></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><h2>A few useful answers.</h2><details><summary>How do I get a price for my rental?</summary><p>Call (352) 306-4409 or send a request with your dates, passenger count and delivery area. Ask the team to confirm availability and a complete quote for those details.</p></details><details><summary>Can I ask about a rental without an exact delivery address?</summary><p>Yes. Share the neighborhood or area you expect to stay in and explain that the address is pending. The team can discuss what information is needed before confirming your reservation and delivery.</p></details><details><summary>What if I’m booking for a group?</summary><p>Tell us the total number of people, how many carts you need, and whether you need to carry equipment. For events, include the venue and delivery and pickup windows so the team can discuss arrangements.</p></details></div></section>
<footer class="closing"><div class="wrap"><h2>Ready to check your dates?</h2><p>Bring your plans. We’ll help you work through the cart and booking details.</p><a class="button" href="tel:+13523064409">Call (352) 306-4409</a></div></footer></article><QuoteForm formName="quote-pricing" hiddenContext={{ "source-page": "pricing" }} />
</Layout><style>
.guide{--ink:#183b30;--paper:#f7f5ef;color:#243d34;background:var(--paper);font-family:Arial,sans-serif}.guide *{box-sizing:border-box}.wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:0 24px}.hero{padding:64px 0 52px;border-bottom:1px solid #d6dfd7}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}.kicker{font-size:13px!important;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#426657} .guide h1{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,60px);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.035em;text-transform:none;font-weight:700;margin:18px 0 24px}.guide h2{font-size:clamp(27px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 20px}.guide h3{font-size:21px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 12px;text-transform:none}.guide p,.guide li{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}.guide p{margin:0 0 18px}.guide a{text-underline-offset:4px}.guide a:not(.button){color:#1d6247;text-decoration:underline}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:15px 22px;border-radius:6px;background:#1b503d;color:#fff;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;min-height:48px}.button:hover{background:#123b2c}.guide a:focus-visible,.guide summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b57719;outline-offset:5px}.note{background:#e5ece4;padding:28px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #cad8cc}.guide ul{list-style:disc;padding-left:22px;margin:12px 0}.guide li+li{margin-top:8px}.section{padding:56px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d6dfd7}.lead{max-width:730px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:28px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7ded8;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.card img{width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:contain;background:#eef1eb}.card-body{padding:24px}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px}.guide details{padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ccd6cd}.guide summary{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;padding:4px 0}.guide details p{margin:16px 0 0}.step{font-size:13px;color:#597060;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:700;display:block;margin-bottom:16px}.closing{padding:48px 0}.guide .links{display:flex;gap:16px 28px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}@media(max-width:720px){.hero-grid,.split,.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.hero{padding:40px 0}.section{padding:36px 0}.wrap{padding:0 20px}.card img{height:210px}.button{width:100%}.guide h1{font-size:38px}}
</style>
